{"4140330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Isida", "steam_appid": 4140330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Isida, an ordinary girl from an ordinary world. But one day, you find yourself in an unfamiliar, gloomy dungeon. What is this place? How did you end up there? Why you? Who owns this unusual dwelling? You must unravel all this yourself, exploring the dungeon step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/extras/523f1debe51a7bf63650e3ae45dfab9b.avif?t=1773749306\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the dungeon, you realize that even the walls here hold secrets, mysteries, traps, and knowledge. To escape, you must learn everything about this place. Be attentive! And remember: curiosity is rewarded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/extras/2ea2daa7f61974020db85ca156388195.avif?t=1773749306\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magic inside</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical power lurks in this strange place. But you too can grasp it. Study ancient magic, for your future may depend on it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/extras/c0acea7a25a226d57789d9ed08b7de1c.avif?t=1773749306\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who's there?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is very different from yours, and... It seems you're not alone here...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are these creatures? What do they want? Can they be trusted? So many questions, and only you can find the answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/extras/072344f879b78713f1fa4c844fd49d9b.avif?t=1773749306\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't give up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects, study scrolls and tapestries, solve mysteries, discover a new world and its possibilities... Find out what happened to you and escape this dark dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/extras/2253f4dfff12aca7b09a30a38574286c.avif?t=1773749306\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Isida, an ordinary girl from an ordinary world. But one day, you find yourself in an unfamiliar, gloomy dungeon. What is this place? How did you end up there? Why you? Who owns this unusual dwelling? You must unravel all this yourself, exploring the dungeon step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/extras/523f1debe51a7bf63650e3ae45dfab9b.avif?t=1773749306\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the dungeon, you realize that even the walls here hold secrets, mysteries, traps, and knowledge. To escape, you must learn everything about this place. Be attentive! And remember: curiosity is rewarded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/extras/2ea2daa7f61974020db85ca156388195.avif?t=1773749306\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magic inside</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical power lurks in this strange place. But you too can grasp it. Study ancient magic, for your future may depend on it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/extras/c0acea7a25a226d57789d9ed08b7de1c.avif?t=1773749306\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who's there?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is very different from yours, and... It seems you're not alone here...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are these creatures? What do they want? Can they be trusted? So many questions, and only you can find the answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/extras/072344f879b78713f1fa4c844fd49d9b.avif?t=1773749306\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't give up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects, study scrolls and tapestries, solve mysteries, discover a new world and its possibilities... Find out what happened to you and escape this dark dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/extras/2253f4dfff12aca7b09a30a38574286c.avif?t=1773749306\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "How did I end up in this mysterious dungeon? Where do I get such magical abilities? Who am I really? I won't stay here forever! Explore the world, solve mysteries, find out the secret of your origin and escape from this dark place!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/086d3e23a58acf8d7c9a358ecb6f58f446668b1f/header.jpg?t=1773749306", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140330/a7aa1b55cb9e53438ded2dd1b17a0cb